# Activation caches written by scripts/run_layer_probe_analysis.py.
#
# These are a regenerable intermediate, not a result: ~2-4 MB per run, and one
# `--dataset`/`--model`/`--noise-snr-db` combination each. The probe results
# themselves (*.json, ~25 KB) ARE the findings and are committed.
*.activations.npz
